[{"id":"advanced_class_guide:class_feature:bloodrager_archetype_bloodrider","label":"Bloodrider","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"In the world's wild lands, a mount is an advantage in both everyday life and the dealing of death. In many barbarian tribes, the true stature of a warrior is determined by his skill and ferocity on horseback. Other tribes measure it in skill atop whatever terrible mounts their people employ. A number of bloodragers are not only skilled in the art of mounted combat, but have learned to channel their arcane energies directly into their mount."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"In the world's wild lands, a mount is an advantage in both everyday life and the dealing of death. In many barbarian tribes, the true stature of a warrior is determined by his skill and ferocity on horseback. Other tribes measure it in skill atop whatever terrible mounts their people employ. A number of bloodragers are not only skilled in the art of mounted combat, but have learned to channel their arcane energies directly into their mount."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false},{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"In the world's wild lands, a mount is an advantage in both everyday life and the dealing of death. In many barbarian tribes, the true stature of a warrior is determined by his skill and ferocity on horseback. Other tribes measure it in skill atop whatever terrible mounts their people employ. A number of bloodragers are not only skilled in the art of mounted combat, but have learned to channel their arcane energies directly into their mount."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"All":[{"Compare":{"lhs":{"ClassLevel":"bloodrager"},"op":"Gte","rhs":{"Const":1}}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_class_guide:class_feature:bloodrager_archetype_bloodrider"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"